/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Keywords in SEO<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Let\u2019s understand the different types of keywords in SEO with examples:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1654\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/seo-keyword-types.webp\" alt=\"Types of Keywords in SEO\" class=\"wp-image-21036\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/seo-keyword-types.webp 1654w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/seo-keyword-types-300x181.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/seo-keyword-types-1024x619.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/seo-keyword-types-768x464.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/seo-keyword-types-1536x929.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1654px) 100vw, 1654px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of SEO Keywords: User\u2019s Search Intent<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Informational Keywords<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Often, customers use informational keywords in the research phase to seek more information about a particular topic. These keywords typically start with the &#8216;&#8221;5Ws and 1H'&#8221;: who, what, when, where, why, and how. Optimizing content with informational keywords help drive organic traffic to your website as potential customers use them to research products or services they may be interested in buying.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Users using informational keywords seek informative, insightful content that answers questions or solves problems.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, if a user types &#8220;how to prepare ghee at home&#8221; into a search engine, they use an informational keyword. Your website might provide a detailed step-by-step guide on preparing ghee and meeting the user&#8217;s information needs.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"744\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/informational-keywords-example-1024x744.png\" alt=\"Informational Keywords Example\" class=\"wp-image-9666\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/informational-keywords-example-1024x744.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/informational-keywords-example-300x218.png 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/informational-keywords-example-768x558.png 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/informational-keywords-example-150x109.png 150w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/informational-keywords-example.png 1092w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>With a consistent use of relevant informational keywords, you can draw in more of your target audience, answering their queries and boosting your SEO ranking.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Commercial Keywords<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Commercial keywords refer to advertising-related searches, such as discount codes and promotional offers businesses set up online to attract more buyers over time. These terms bring people directly into contact with your company and offer valuable insights about customer preferences, which you can use when planning campaigns for future marketing efforts. These keywords usually include \u2018buy,\u2019 \u2018price,\u2019 \u2018best,\u2019 \u2018review,\u2019 and \u2018comparison.\u2019<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, suppose a user enters the search term \u201cBest mobile phone under \u20b910000\u201c. This commercial keyword indicates that the user is likely to purchase and is comparing their options.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"906\" height=\"787\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/commercial-keywords.png\" alt=\"Commercial Keywords\" class=\"wp-image-9668\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/commercial-keywords.png 906w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/commercial-keywords-300x261.png 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/commercial-keywords-768x667.png 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/commercial-keywords-150x130.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 906px) 100vw, 906px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>By optimizing your site with these keywords, you can direct highly targeted, ready-to-buy users to your website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Transactional Keywords<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Users use transactional keywords when they are in the conversion phase of the purchase funnel. They already know what they want and use particular buying keywords to help them find the right place to purchase. Customers ready to buy often use transactional keywords, including terms like &#8216;purchase,&#8217; &#8216;order,&#8217; &#8216;buy now,&#8217; and &#8216;discount codes.&#8217;<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"912\" height=\"677\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/transactional-keywords.webp\" alt=\"Transactional Keywords\" class=\"wp-image-9669\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/transactional-keywords.webp 912w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/transactional-keywords-300x223.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/transactional-keywords-768x570.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/transactional-keywords-150x111.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 912px) 100vw, 912px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>For example, users who search \u201cOrder iPhone 14\u201d in a search engine are likely primed and ready to buy. By integrating relevant transactional keywords, you can capture these ready-to-convert visitors and guide them to your site.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Navigational Keywords<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Users use navigational keywords while looking for a particular website, product, brand, or service online. This type of query implies an intention to take action\u2014usually visiting the website directly\u2014so it allows marketers more opportunities for conversions if their page appears at the top of SERPs for such terms. These keywords often include brand names, product names, or the names of specific services.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example, a user searches for &#8220;Nike Running Shoes for Men&#8221;. If you have effectively optimized your site for this navigational keyword, the user should find your website at the top of the search results.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"922\" height=\"771\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/navigational-keywords.webp\" alt=\"Navigational Keywords \" class=\"wp-image-9670\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/navigational-keywords.webp 922w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/navigational-keywords-300x251.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/navigational-keywords-768x642.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/05\/navigational-keywords-150x125.webp 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 922px) 100vw, 922px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p>By understanding and utilizing these navigational keywords, you can ensure that your website is found effortlessly by users explicitly searching for it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\"Cracking Meta &amp; Google Ads 2026 - Data, Automation &amp; Attribution\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/ai-engineering-roadmap-2026?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T123426_340_1785490284771_211381.webp\" alt=\"AI Engineering Roadmap 2026\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/how-to-build-an-ai-agent-from-scratch?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen